abstract: >-
  Python code, BioModels SBML inputs, and derived numerical data supporting a
  structural-kinetic, substrate-gain, continuation, regulatory-bistability,
  compatibility-space spectral, and native meal-cycle analysis of hepatic
  polyamine metabolism. The archive is a reproducibility object only and does
  not contain the article manuscript or supplementary material.
